490
00:08:50,427 --> 00:08:52,547
<i>Suspected of phantastic pseudology?</i>

491
00:08:57,307 --> 00:08:58,557
<i>This isn't going to work.</i>

492
00:08:59,307 --> 00:09:00,937
But listen, Daedalus.

493
00:09:01,977 --> 00:09:03,937
Do you have any idea how I feel?

494
00:09:04,607 --> 00:09:07,487
