595
00:14:57,327 --> 00:14:58,577
Impossible...

596
00:15:03,837 --> 00:15:06,007
New homes are so nice.

597
00:15:06,007 --> 00:15:07,837
This has a good view too.

598
00:15:09,337 --> 00:15:10,387
Re-l?

599
00:15:11,927 --> 00:15:13,177
Oh, sorry.

600
00:15:13,177 --> 00:15:14,597
Did you say something?

601
00:15:14,597 --> 00:15:15,347
Jeez.

602
00:15:15,347 --> 00:15:17,227
Did something happen with your prince?

603
00:15:19,597 --> 00:15:20,607
Iggy...

604
00:15:21,607 --> 00:15:23,567
You are being watched.

605
00:15:24,357 --> 00:15:25,237
Sorry.

606
00:15:25,737 --> 00:15:26,647
Re-l,

607
00:15:27,237 --> 00:15:28,197
where are you going?

608
00:15:29,527 --> 00:15:32,577
I'm going to get a change of clothes.

609
00:15:32,577 --> 00:15:33,987
"Get"?

610
00:15:33,987 --> 00:15:37,497
I think your place's still under the Security Bureau's jurisdiction.

611
00:15:37,957 --> 00:15:39,787
I want a change.

612
00:15:40,207 --> 00:15:42,747
I've been wearing this since yesterday.

613
00:15:42,747 --> 00:15:45,127
I'll have trouble finding things to wear from tomorrow on.

614
00:15:45,127 --> 00:15:47,297
Why don't you use this opportunity
 to get yourself a brand-new wardrobe?

615
00:15:47,297 --> 00:15:50,007
Why would you have any reason to go there?

616
00:15:51,427 --> 00:15:52,677
<i>Grandfather...</i>

617
00:15:52,677 --> 00:15:54,677
<i>So not only does he watch me</i>

618
00:15:54,677 --> 00:15:56,177
<i>but he also wishes to manipulate me.</i>

619
00:15:56,767 --> 00:15:57,807
Well...

620
00:15:58,307 --> 00:16:00,267
I don't see anything I want in the new line-up.

621
00:16:00,267 --> 00:16:01,097
What?

622
00:16:01,097 --> 00:16:03,647
You were saying this morning that you
 were going to go on a shopping spree.

623
00:16:03,647 --> 00:16:04,517
Wait.

624
00:16:04,517 --> 00:16:05,857
I know a good place.

625
00:16:05,857 --> 00:16:07,357
Let's go there together.

626
00:16:14,407 --> 00:16:15,947
How about this?

627
00:16:16,537 --> 00:16:19,157
The colors are perfect for this season too...

628
00:16:21,207 --> 00:16:22,247
Re-l?

629
00:17:19,557 --> 00:17:20,597
That's...

630
00:18:49,597 --> 00:18:50,807
Chief!

631
00:18:55,567 --> 00:18:57,237
Please issue commands to the Security Bureau.

632
00:18:59,817 --> 00:19:03,027
Request an emergency sortie of armed autoreivs.

633
00:19:03,027 --> 00:19:06,947
Seal off Yoslis Park and the surrounding sectors.

634
00:19:06,947 --> 00:19:08,287
Use barriers.

635
00:19:08,287 --> 00:19:09,287
Understood.

636
00:20:37,087 --> 00:20:38,667
Report.

637
00:20:38,667 --> 00:20:42,047
Forty-two adult and infant deaths.

638
00:20:42,047 --> 00:20:44,427
Forty-eight wounded.

639
00:20:44,427 --> 00:20:48,717
All the citizens within the mall were secured in isolation facilities.

640
00:20:48,717 --> 00:20:49,807
What about the specimen?

641
00:20:50,387 --> 00:20:51,847
It has breached the barriers

642
00:20:51,847 --> 00:20:53,387
and is still at large.

643
00:20:56,937 --> 00:20:59,107
This is surveillance footage from sector N-31.

644
00:21:00,107 --> 00:21:04,147
The specimen is estimated to have
 already reached the lower sectors.

645
00:21:52,617 --> 00:21:53,697
It wasn't a dream...

646
00:21:54,367 --> 00:21:56,077
It was real.

647
00:22:28,357 --> 00:22:29,607
It's Papa!

648
00:23:06,107 --> 00:23:07,527
Damn!

649
00:23:10,527 --> 00:23:11,907
Damn!

650
00:23:18,447 --> 00:23:19,997
Damn!

651
00:23:43,557 --> 00:23:44,727
He...

